      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "National Forestry (Amendment) Bill 2022"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 19 the following section: “Issuance of licences by Director 19a. Licences may, subject to any contrary direction by the State Authority and to any rules, be issued or renewed on behalf of the State Authority by the Director.”. Amendment of section 21"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 21(1) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “of twelve months” the words “not exceeding twelve months”. Amendment of section 25"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 25(2) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “shall be guilty of an offence and shall on conviction be liable to a fine not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both such fine and imprisonment; and if the offence is a continuing one” the words “commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding seven years or to both, and in the case of a continuing offence”. New section 29a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 29 the following section: “Minor licence area 29a. Before any minor licence is issued, the Director shall require an applicant to submit a plan of the area or part of the area within which operations will be carried out by the applicant.”. New section 31a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 31 the following section: “Ceasing of operation, suspension and revocation of minor licence 31a. The provisions relating to ceasing of operation in a licensed area in sections 25 and 26 and the provisions relating to suspension and revocation of licence in section 27 shall apply to a minor licence.”. Amendment of section 32"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 32 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2) Any person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding seven years or to both.”. Amendment of section 40"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 40 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2) Any person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction— (a) in relation to a major forest produce— (i) where the volume is less than five cubic metres, be liable to a fine not exceeding twenty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both; or (ii) where the volume is five cubic metres or more, be liable to a fine not exceeding five hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding ten years or to both; and (b) in relation to a minor forest produce, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both.”. Amendment of section 43"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_17__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_17__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_17__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 43 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_17__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by inserting after the words “issue thereof” the words “and in accordance with subsection (2a), may be renewed from time to time”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_17__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2a) The Director may, on the application of a holder of a removal licence made not later than thirty days before the expiry of the removal licence, renew the removal licence for a term not exceeding six months, and the Director may vary, delete or add to the provisions contained in the removal licence.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_17__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (3), by inserting after the words “Form 5” the words “and if a removal licence is renewed, it shall be endorsed with a note of such renewal and the date of its expiry”. Amendment of section 47"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 47 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18__para_a__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18__para_a__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (a) the following paragraph: “(aa) a holder of a minor licence, his servants or agents, but only for the purpose of exercising the rights granted by the minor licence;”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (d), by deleting the word “and” at the end of the paragraph; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18__para_a__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (d) the following paragraph: “(da) a holder of a road permit, his servants or agents, but only for the purpose of exercising the rights granted by the road permit; and”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (4) the following subsection: “(4) Any person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding twenty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both.”. Amendment of section 48"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 48 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “47(a), (c) and (d)” the words “47(a), (aa), (c), (d) and (da)”. Amendment of section 50"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the National Forestry (Amendment) Act 2022 and shall apply throughout Malaysia."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act shall not come into operation in a State unless it has been adopted by a law made by the Legislature of the State pursuant to Clause (3) of Article 76 of the Federal Constitution."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation in the Federal Territories of Kuala Lumpur, Labuan and Putrajaya on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_2__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_2__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_2__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_2__para_f",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_2__para_g",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_2__para_h",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_2__para_i"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The National Forestry Act 1984 [Act 313], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 2—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_20__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_20__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 50 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_20__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by inserting after the words “the Director” the words “or by a forest officer authorized by the Director to issue a road permit”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_20__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (4) the following subsection: “(4) Any person who contravenes this section commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding thirty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both.”. New section 50a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 50 the following section: “Durations, conditions, etc., and renewal of road permits 50a. (1) Except in so far as it is otherwise prescribed, every road permit shall be issued for a term expiring not later than the end of the calendar year in which it commences, and in accordance with subsection (3), may be renewed from time to time. (2) Every road permit shall have effect subject to such provisions as may be contained in the road permit, and so far as not inconsistent therewith, to any other provision which may be prescribed. (3) The Director may, on the application of a holder of a road permit made not later than thirty days before the expiry of the road permit, renew the road permit for a term not exceeding one calendar year, and the Director may vary, delete or add to the provisions contained in the road permit.”. Amendment of section 58"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_22__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_22__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_22__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 58 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_22__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/1/eng@/~cl_22__para_a__subpara_i",
