        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 70 the following section: “Pass other than removal pass 70a. Notwithstanding anything contained in this Act, the State Authority may issue any pass other than a removal pass in the form and manner as may be prescribed by the State Authority to any person who has in his possession, custody or control any forest produce.”. Amendment of section 73"
      }
